            "description": "<html><body><p data-eci=\"true\"><figure class=\"getty-figure\" data-type=\"getty-image\"><picture> <img alt=\"District heating plant construction in Schleswig, Germany\" data-id=\"2285307753\" data-type=\"getty-image\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"1024\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 36px), (max-width: 1023px) calc(100vw - 132px), (max-width: 1199px) calc(100vw - 666px), (max-width: 1307px) calc(100vw - 708px), 600px\" src=\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2285307753/image_2285307753.jpg?io=getty-c-w630\" srcset=\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2285307753/image_2285307753.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536 1536w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2285307753/image_2285307753.jpg?io=getty-c-w1280 1280w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2285307753/image_2285307753.jpg?io=getty-c-w1080 1080w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2285307753/image_2285307753.jpg?io=getty-c-w750 750w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2285307753/image_2285307753.jpg?io=getty-c-w640 640w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2285307753/image_2285307753.jpg?io=getty-c-w480 480w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2285307753/image_2285307753.jpg?io=getty-c-w320 320w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2285307753/image_2285307753.jpg?io=getty-c-w240 240w\" width=\"1536\"/> </picture><figcaption><p class=\"item-caption\"> </p> <p class=\"item-credits\">VeugerStock/iStock Editorial via Getty Images</p></figcaption></figure></p>  <h2><strong>Investment Thesis</strong></h2> <p>Perma-Pipe International Holdings, Inc. (<span class=\"ticker-hover-wrapper\"><a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/PPIH\" title=\"Perma-Pipe International Holdings, Inc.\">PPIH</a></span>) is entering a virtuous cycle because of the economics of its engineered systems, district heating and cooling demand, and reinvestment in growth.</p> <p>It is a development that</p></body></html>",
